        "nobel_worthiness": "Virus-like-particle HPV vaccines constitute a highly consequential preventive medical advance, with a direct route from molecular insight to cancer prevention.",
        "attribution": "The listed researchers represent central complementary contributions to the vaccine concept and its development; a three-person award can recognize that chain.",
        "maturity": "The intervention has had extensive real-world implementation and its preventive benefit is well established.",
