        "nobel_worthiness": "TNF blockade transformed treatment of rheumatoid arthritis and established a general therapeutic strategy for inflammatory disease.",
        "attribution": "Feldmann and Maini form a well-defined partnership linking pathogenic cytokine rationale to clinical proof of principle.",
        "maturity": "Benefits across inflammatory disorders have been repeatedly confirmed in clinical practice over a long interval.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Translation included substantial pharmaceutical and clinical-network contributions beyond the two proposed laureates."
        ]
      }
    },
